# Conformance probe pack for a `rest` item that reads no bits (spec 0.21
# ruling 1), most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   p           one presence bit, then 7 unused bits
#   nums        items to the end of the message; an item is val in 8 bits
#               when p.1 is 1, and nothing when it is 0
format     conformance-extents-zero
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
presence p 1
pad 7
group   probe.nums rest
  if p.1
    field  probe.val  8  uint
  end
end
